Photoshop 26.10.0's own layered CMYK, Grayscale and Lab Color TIFFs saved with
byte order IBM PC (little-endian, "II") at 8 and 16 bits, each beside its
Macintosh-order ("MM") twin, from the private harness's
scripts/photoshop-probe/tiff_le_77_take.py (and its tiff_le_77.jsx; receipts in
~/devel/doctored-fixtures/photoshop/tiff-little-endian-77/<take>). Synthetic
content the runner declared; Photoshop built, converted and saved it.

Each take builds one RGB document per depth from the runner's RGBA PNGs, the
scenes of tiff_le_53_take.py (photoshop.json's "scenes"): Bottom; Top (opaque at
x < top_keep, transparent beyond) in the scene's blend mode and opacity; a group
(Pass Through) holding Inner (partial alpha in its lower rows); Masked (a Reveal
Selection user mask from mask_rect, then hidden). Each document is converted by
ONE Image > Mode conversion without flattening (Fltt and Mrge false) to CMYK,
Grayscale or Lab Color and saved four times as a copy: layer compression RLE
then ZIP, each with byte order IBM then MACOS; layers and transparency on, image
compression NONE; CMYK and Grayscale embed their profile, Lab has none.

Files named <scene>_<model>_<bits>_<rle|zip>_<ibm|mac>.tif. The entries whose
"location" is "repo" are here, IBM file and twin; the "store" entries (every
CMYK file: each carries its ~0.5 MB output profile) are read from the receipts
at "path" under the folder above, and their tests skip when it is absent.

photoshop.json holds each take's run id, Photoshop version and per-model build
row, the scenes' declarations, and per IBM file: its model, take, location and
path, sha256 and size; its twin's name, path and sha256; Photoshop's rows of
the file and of its twin reopened; the twin's records (rectangle as top, left,
bottom, right; blend key; opacity byte; flags; the lsct section type; the mask)
with each channel's compression word, rectangle and the SHA-256 of its decoded
plane, samples big-endian at the file's depth; and the judge's reading of each
channel (its word, its verdict for that model and depth, the confirmed
candidate's misses and the share its rival missed).
core/tests/tiff_layers_little_modes.rs opens every file it can reach layered and
checks it against its twin opened the same way, the twin's records and plane
hashes, the judge, and Photoshop's rows.
